WEBVTT

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.740
Please don't let him near my son ever again.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:15.140
Ma'am, he's not like everyone else.
 He can see spirits.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.320
Please help him.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.910
He can see spirits? There's no way!

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.210
That monster is apparently 
still in the hospital.

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:26.830
My mom says everyone in that family is weird.

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:29.210
His mom is definitely weird.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:33.340
Can I help you?

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:38.010
Oh, excuse me, is the family 
that lives here out right now?

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:42.850
The neighbors moved somewhere 
about a month ago.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:45.700
<i>I didn't get to say goodbye.</i>

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:50.360
<i>Life is a never-ending cycle 
of meetings and departures.</i>

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:56.310
<i>Even when you try to look 
back, no one is there.</i>

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:11.550
<i>~Bond of the Underworld~</i>

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:33.660
Episode 3
Blood-Stained Snow

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:32.220
<i>Will you really find that boy for me?</i>

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:33.640
<i>Of course I will.</i>

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:35.130
<i>I want to protect him.</i>

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:38.090
<i>I promised him he wouldn't be alone.</i>

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:42.410
<i>He got hurt because I looked away.</i>

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:45.180
<i>I want another chance.</i>

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.530
I'll give you that chance.

00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:48.980
You Keika!

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.480
What are you doing?

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:56.500
Tanmoku Ki, I'm talking with
 the stone boy right now.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.530
You can see him, can't you?
 He's right here.

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:00.490
<i>What's wrong with him?</i>

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:02.490
Stone boy, look.

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:04.910
It's the Youmeishi you wanted to meet.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:05.990
Is this the culprit?

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:07.450
Stop it!

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:09.780
What are you doing?

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:10.330
Don't!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.780
That stone is possessed.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:14.000
The stone boy isn't here.

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:17.000
What you're seeing is an illusion!

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:23.510
I know you the best, Mr. Spirit Shadow.

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:26.460
See? He's right there.

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:28.620
You Keika, snap out of it!

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:30.520
Stone boy?

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.270
<i>His eyes are blank.</i>

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.190
<i>Is he being hypnotized?</i>

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:38.540
<i>You would need an implement to place 
such a strong suggestion.</i>

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.700
<i>Is that poisoned?</i>

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:45.530
<i>Who could have done this? And when?</i>

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:55.960
The poison is taking hold in his heart and 
simply showing him his strongest desire.

00:03:57.190 --> 00:04:02.130
<i>Why didn't I notice such an elaborate spell?</i>

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.280
<i>I'm sorry, Keika.</i>

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.970
Tanmoku Ki, what are you doing?

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:10.220
I'm going to destroy the stone 
to free you from the spell.

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:13.680
Destroy it? It's the stone boy's real form.

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:15.560
There are still things I want to ask him.

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:19.980
Mr. Spirit Shadow, I know where that boy is.

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.570
You do? Where is he?

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:24.760
He is...

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:32.410
Yes.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.250
Stone boy?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:38.750
Stone boy!

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:43.760
Just a little bit more and 
I would've known where he is...

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.210
Why did this happen?

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:48.910
Why?!

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:50.930
Why did you destroy him?!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.350
Why did you get in my way?

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:05.030
What's wrong with me?

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:06.650
When did this happen?

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.510
I can't control the rage in my heart.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:18.180
<i>I just want to protect one person, 
so why can't I do it right?</i>

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.170
Preparations are complete.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:29.470
Next time Tanmoku Ki goes out, that 
spirit shadow won't accompany him.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:33.490
I leave the rest to you.

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:42.820
<i>Hey, where are you?</i>

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.400
I'm right in front of you.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.540
In front? No you aren't.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:49.160
I'm diagonal to your right about 45 degrees.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.330
Oh, there you are.

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:54.090
You've really covered yourself up.

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:55.960
It's not like we're on a date.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.170
My hair color stands out.

00:05:58.930 --> 00:05:59.690
Let's go.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:01.890
Let's hurry and get this over with.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:05.670
Let's take a selfie together first!

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:09.160
A business trip to Iceland?

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:12.430
Yeah, he left by high-speed rail yesterday.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:17.320
I can't see him for a whole week. 
I'm gonna wither up and die.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:19.130
Then you should've gone with him.

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:20.520
He told me no!

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:23.110
He said he'd have someone with him, 
and I thought for sure he meant you!

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:27.030
Then who is he with?
I haven't heard anything.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.190
Tsk, aren't you his spirit shadow?

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:32.770
You're clinging to him every day. 
Shouldn't you know everything?

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:36.630
I haven't heard anything...

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.620
I'm sure he didn't say anything on purpose.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:42.130
Who did he go with?

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:46.460
Speak of the devil.

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:52.470
<i>If you want your fiance 
back, pay the ransom.</i>

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:55.680
Screw him! I want to punch the 
crap out of that bastard, Ouyou!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.980
Who is Ouyou?

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:02.190
He's a feng shui master. He said he's 
accompanying Tanmoku-san on this trip.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:04.980
You'll live a healthy life with 
fortunes from the Ouyou family.

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.980
Ouyou You

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.890
Blemishes, freckles, wrinkles:

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:10.950
one phone call and I'll come rushing over 
to give you a heart-warming treatment.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:15.150
You're handsome, but 
you've got a screw loose.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:17.670
There are limits for a woman my age.

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:20.310
Believe in miracles! Don't give up!

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:22.040
You can't fight aging!

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:25.250
Keep it down. I told you not to make a scene.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:29.010
We're on a journey;
 try to relax a bit more.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.510
Okay, open wide.

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:33.990
Stop screwing around. If you don't, I'll—

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:37.850
This is our target location.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.180
The tunnel paths were cut 
by a boring machine.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.590
Large-scale landslides 
are frequently occurring.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:45.140
The local government can't handle it either.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:48.760
We will repair the tunnel paths and 
change the flow of the feng shui.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:50.410
Okay, got it.

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:53.450
Hey, that reminds me. You made a 
contract with a spirit shadow, right?

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:54.890
Why didn't you bring him?

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:57.570
He has no interest in these kinds of jobs.

00:07:57.570 --> 00:07:59.370
He's probably absorbed in a game right now.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.840
Huh? A game?

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:03.980
You made a spirit shadow 
contract with a fanboy?

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:09.260
That idiot's really worked up today.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:11.710
I guess he's in a bad mood because 
his master abandoned him.

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:15.140
You're awfully enthusiastic.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.650
Yesterday, you practiced late into the night.

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:20.190
Are you frustrated that your master is away?

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.420
What a piece of work!

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:26.400
How's it feel to be single?

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:29.610
In Tetsu, I don't get it.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:31.740
I don't know what's going on with us.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:37.100
I've never felt that "sharing life and 
death together" feeling that you mentioned.

00:08:37.940 --> 00:08:41.250
Our hearts probably aren't 
communicating with one another.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:45.250
Sometimes I doubt whether I'm 
really his spirit shadow or not.

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:48.930
Don't tell him about this.

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:52.320
I don't know what you're so worried about,

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:57.050
but a spirit shadow absolutely cannot 
disobey the will of its master.

00:08:58.190 --> 00:09:00.210
Once you've made the contract,

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:05.460
it is engraved on your souls, and 
no one will be able to separate you.

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:09.020
That's enough practice for today.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:10.440
Review what you've learned.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:18.110
In Tetsu-sama, that's just 
the ideal scenario, right?

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:22.490
The bond between spirit shadow and 
Youmeishi is tougher than anything.

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:26.750
However, it will become 
fragile if the heart wavers.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:30.880
Why are you wearing so many 
layers? Sensitive to the cold?

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:32.130
Is it because of that time?

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.010
Idiot.

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:39.580
It's so cold! Why is it so cold?

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.600
Let's get going. I want 
to get this over with.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:44.260
Hey, wait up! Hold me close and warm me up.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:45.470
The target is heading 
towards the mission area.

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:47.350
We will carry out the mission tomorrow.

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:50.510
Try not to get regular people involved.

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:51.730
Are you sure about this?

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:55.360
Don't worry. The Youmeishi 
won't die so easily.

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:59.360
If we hurt him and make him bleed a bit,

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:02.990
then the members of the Tanmoku 
family will move quickly.

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:07.540
And show their true colors.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:09.770
Come in.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:13.840
Jimei, did Ki make it all right?

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:17.220
Yes, but he is not at the hotel.

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:18.560
What's that?

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:21.220
According to the GPS,
 he's in the mountains.

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:26.350
Mountains? Is he alone with a
member of the Ouyou family?

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:27.850
That seems to be the case.

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:29.990
That is odd.

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:33.550
Jimei-niisan, let me see the request form.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:39.270
There are many faults on the ice 
field far from human habitation.

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:42.500
And there's apparently a pack 
of wolves that's been appearing.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:44.740
This is bad. If the worst should happen...

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.570
If he gets targeted by 
someone while he's there...

00:10:47.570 --> 00:10:49.960
Why isn't he staying in the 
hotel that was arranged?

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:55.460
The hotel's water pipe burst and 
his room became flooded, so...

00:10:55.460 --> 00:11:00.970
Jimei, call Ki right away and 
have him leave that place!

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.450
Why did you turn it off?

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:13.540
We'll sleep more soundly 
if your phone doesn't ring.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:14.330
Give it back.

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:16.630
Come on, give me a break!

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:22.060
It's bad enough that we can't stay at the 
hotel and have to stay at this rundown inn.

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:26.330
And the ceremony is at 5 AM. 
Aren't you going to let me sleep?

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.900
The location of the ceremony is nearby.

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:33.080
You say that, but we're still 
getting up at 4 AM, right?

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.210
Whatever. I'm going to bed.

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:44.800
Tanmoku, shall I warm up your futon?

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.930
No, that's dirty.

00:11:57.190 --> 00:12:00.010
That spirit shadow is showing 
up this early to practice?

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:01.450
Because spirits don't sleep.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:04.610
You're giving it your all, aren't you?

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.980
I'll have a strong youkai brought 
to be your practice partner.

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:11.330
I don't need it.

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:14.210
My, you're awfully caustic today.

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:18.090
I'm done playing teacher 
and student with you.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:27.960
So cold! I can't believe it 
snowed this much in one night.

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:32.810
Why are we doing the ceremony at 5 AM? 
It's cold and really bad for my feet.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:36.500
We're going home on the 9 o'clock train,
 so we're leaving here at 7 AM.

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:39.320
Wha? We're finishing this in two hours?

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:44.250
Hurry up and find the 
eye of the wind already.

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:45.730
Good grief.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:48.910
If you're so worried about your spirit shadow,
 you should've just brought him with you.

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:50.190
What was that?

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:52.660
No, nothing at all.

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:01.430
The eye of the wind is there.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:03.730
Are you sure?

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:08.760
No one can do feng shui or tell 
fortunes like the Ouyou family.

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:26.360
Amazing. That's a Youmeishi for you.

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:28.060
I'm finished.

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:29.530
Already?!

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.810
Hey, Tanmoku, how did you do that?

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:34.080
The flow of the mountain's 
energy has changed.

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:36.290
If there are no problems, let's go.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:40.490
It's no wonder you're so 
popular with the higher-ups.

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:42.880
Hey, team up with me.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:45.840
With you as the straight guy 
and me as your funny man,

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.800
we'd make a genius pairing that 
could take over the world.

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:50.190
What's wrong?

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:55.750
What's going on?

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:58.090
What's with that pack of white wolves?

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:03.780
Don't freak out, and stay 
behind me. The wolves will—

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:07.580
Ouyou!

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:22.920
I'm your teacher whether you like it or not!

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:25.170
Don't order me around.

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:30.300
There's no point in my training
if he doesn't need me.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:35.180
You dumbass!

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:50.950
<i>Keika...</i>

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:56.830
This knife was given to 
me by Tanmoku Ki's father.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:01.480
At the time I didn't know 
anything, like you now.

00:15:02.090 --> 00:15:04.210
This is the only thing I have left of Gin.

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:07.750
I'm sure he's given you something too.

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:12.770
Never cut this string.

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:16.300
You Keika, stop!

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.810
What is left for you now?

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:23.890
Do not take off the spirit binding rings.

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:34.820
Those are something I once wore, but Gin took them off himself.

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:36.830
These rings are...

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:40.350
The spirit binding rings are a tool 
passed down through the Tanmoku family,

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.670
and that's the only set in the world.

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:46.820
If you treat them poorly, 
I will take them from you.

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:49.670
How much do you think I want it?

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:56.910
Wh-What's happening to my body?

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.270
Th-This is...

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:05.690
The Youmeishi's spirit summoning spell.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.180
Has something happened to Ki-chan?

00:16:08.180 --> 00:16:10.030
We can't leave here.

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:14.530
If he was able to summon him,
 then he's alive at least.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.700
Should we have someone go see?

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:23.560
No. If he is actually in some kind 
of danger, we should keep it secret.

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:26.210
We can't trust the youkai.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:31.550
I just hope that spirit shadow 
doesn't forget what I taught him.

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:43.220
My head is spinning...

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:44.960
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:46.010
Keika...

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:47.700
Tanmoku!

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:50.730
What happened? That's a lot of blood!

00:16:55.910 --> 00:17:00.140
<i>Right now, all the misunderstandings 
and reservations have disappeared.</i>

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:03.460
<i>Pride and position don't matter.</i>

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:08.470
<i>There's only one thing in my heart 
right now: protect Tanmoku Ki!</i>

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:12.760
<i>I'll lose him, if I don't protect him.</i>

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:16.570
Stupid wolves!

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:17.970
Keika...

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:22.810
I'm sorry. I wasn't 
planning on summoning you.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.660
But I realized something:

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:30.110
Without you, I am useless.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:35.460
Tanmoku, let's go home together.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:42.280
But how do we get home from here?

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:45.260
My cell phone is on the cliff.

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:48.790
Use that to call Jimei-san.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:50.770
Look out!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.050
So you've finally shown yourselves.

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:58.300
Why don't you fight fair and 
square without the wolves?

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:00.550
I'll take you all on.

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:04.210
And there's a bunch of them...

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:07.790
Keika, be careful. They're all mediums.

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:08.900
Got it.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:13.020
I'll dispose of all of you at once!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.410
Wh-What?

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.410
An evil spirit? 
With numbers like these...

00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:26.330
I'll back you up.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:29.870
Tanmoku Ki!

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:35.340
Yes, that's right.

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:38.860
The Youmeishi cannot hurt humans

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:41.310
and the spirit shadow has very 
little battle experience.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.780
The inexperienced spirit shadow 
is restrained by the evil spirit,

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:48.970
while the Youmeishi who cannot hurt humans
 with his powers is being held back.

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:51.020
You guys are totally unfair.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:54.340
You're not going to seal me away like this.

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:57.030
I'm impervious to debuffs!

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:00.210
Keika, look out behind you!

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:06.260
<i>How cowardly.</i>

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:14.040
Keika!

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:22.470
It doesn't hurt in the least though!

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:29.730
Tanmoku!

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:32.060
What are you doing?

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:34.310
Get lost!

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:37.730
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:42.070
Let go!

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:59.090
I'll cut down everyone in my way.

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:04.580
Damn it...

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:09.680
Did you see how serious I was?

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:11.270
Keika...

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:14.690
Keika!

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:19.170
What were you thinking, 
stabbing yourself like that?

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:24.610
I don't have a body, so I thought 
the sword would just go through me.

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:28.120
This is the Rakugetsu sword.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.830
You can just heal me with a kiss, right?

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:37.250
You can do it twice, if you have to.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:40.700
I finally got to put on 
a good show. Praise me.

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.490
You are so...

00:20:42.490 --> 00:20:44.970
This is different than 
just your soul scattering.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.550
What are you doing?

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:53.200
This is that weird circle 
you were drawing everyday.

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:56.350
So this is what you use it for?

00:20:57.370 --> 00:21:00.090
Keika, focus.

00:21:00.090 --> 00:21:01.650
Hold on strongly to your feelings.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.400
Tanmoku Ki...

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:09.240
We will meet again someday...

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:12.980
Keika?

00:22:46.440 --> 00:23:00.460
Next Episode
Preview

00:22:47.710 --> 00:22:50.970
I will protect you... without fail, I will.

00:22:50.970 --> 00:22:52.930
You wanting to protect me is...

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:55.250
Shouken? Who's that?

00:22:55.250 --> 00:22:57.850
No matter what happens, you 
have to stay away from him.

00:22:55.430 --> 00:23:00.460
<b>Most Special Person</b>

00:22:57.850 --> 00:23:00.460
You are not worthy
 to meet him.
